flickos-phone (1.29) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Sending files to the phone: a file counts as sent only once the
    phone has every byte, so a small file the phone dropped is no longer
    reported as sent, and a file is offered up to three times instead of
    twice. A phone that was idle a few seconds may take nothing for 10 s
    on a new connection, and its app then gives up.

